OL,3,GNEWSAExtra patrols as luxury cars
OL,4,Atargeted in burglaries
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have increased patrols in parts
OL,7,Fof Leicestershire after a spate of
OL,8,Fburglaries targeting "high performance
OL,9,Fand luxury cars".
OL,11,FOfficers from Leicestershire Police
OL,12,Fsaid they have been conducting extra
OL,13,Fpatrols in Desford, Groby, Twycross and
OL,14,FMarket Bosworth.
OL,16,FMarket Bosworth's beat team said they
OL,17,Fhad been supported by plain-clothed
OL,18,Fofficers, as well roads policing,
OL,19,Ffirearms, dog officers and response
OL,20,Fcolleagues.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
